"=========================\n"
"Project My Tasks By Stage\n"
"=========================\n"
"\n"
"This module is very useful if all the projects share the same tasks stages and changes the way tasks are displayed in the sub-menu \"My tasks\".\n"
"Instead of showing the user his tasks grouped by personal stages, now it will display them grouped by the project's task stage.\n"
"\n"
